sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant API as Shortener API
    participant ID as ID generator
    participant DB as URL store
    participant Ca as Cache
    participant V as Visitor
    U->>API: POST long URL
    API->>ID: next unique id
    ID-->>API: base62 short code
    API->>DB: store code to URL
    API-->>U: short URL
    V->>API: GET /abc123
    API->>Ca: look up the code
    alt hit
        Ca-->>V: 302 to the original
    else miss
        API->>DB: read
        DB-->>API: original URL
        API->>Ca: populate
        API-->>V: 302 Found
    end
    Note over API,V: 302 not 301 — a cached 301 means later clicks never reach you
